<font size="-1" face="arial, helvetica"> <p> <strong> <font color="#000066">Merriam-Webster's Word of the Day for October 11, 2026 is:</font> </strong> </p> <p> <strong>galore</strong> &#149; \guh-LOR\&nbsp; &#149; <em>adjective</em><br /> <p><em>Galore</em> is an informal adjective that describes something as being in large numbers or amounts. It is always used postpositively, that is, after a noun.</p> <p>// The store promises bargains <em>galore</em> on Black Friday.</p> <p><a href="https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/galore">See the entry ></a></p> </p> </font>
</description>
